<title>HONG KONG: Siam Commercial Bank sets US$100 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Siam Commercial Bank sets US$100 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by bookrunner BA Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIAM COMMERCIAL BANK, ACTING THROUGH ITS HK BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$100 MLN  COUPON     3ML+35BP  MATURITY     JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCHED  05.MAY.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	NONE	REPLIES   23.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> RATING     A3/BBB+ **  SALE LMTS  US/UK/HK/SING/THAI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  THAILAND    GOV LAW    --	  PAY DATE  12.JUN.97</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   LEAD MANAGERS     US$7 MLN+    40BP   ALL-IN  43</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS  US$5 MLN     35BP   ALL-IN  42</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	    US$3 MLN     30BP   ALL-IN  41</p>
<p> ARRANGERS    BA ASIA (BOOKS), NOMURA INTERNATIONAL (HONG KONG)</p>
<p>		  AND SAKURA FINANCE ASIA</p>
<p> NOTES	  CLEARING THROUGH EUROCLEAR/CEDEL</p>
<p>		  **ISSUER RATINGS</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
